// (DUEL_ATOM_SMITH_GKE_ENDPOINT is deleted). When two learners match, sharing
// persists the duel as `preparing`, publishes this request in the same
// transaction, pushes `preparing` on the duel WebSocket, and on the result
// applies the picks (StartBattle) and pushes `ready`.
